[REQUIREMENT]
UID: TVC-REQ-013
LEVEL: L2
REQUIREMENT_TYPE: Interface
TITLE: Flight Computer Area
APPLICABLE_SUBSYSTEM: Avionics, Airframe
SUBTEAM_OWNER: Structures, Electrical
